id: pm-brief-agze
title: "Honor SDK blockers, lifecycle roles and UTF-8 brief budgets"
description: "Verify and address audit F03, F05 and F14 using the pinned SDK, real non-git trackers and independent behavioural revert proofs."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: fix,"gh:unbraind/pm-brief#173",sdk
